{
  "name": "LinkedIn Company Deep Dive - Org Chart Builder",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🏢 LinkedIn Company Deep Dive - Org Chart Builder\n\n**What it does:** Extracts complete company intelligence from LinkedIn - processes MULTIPLE company URLs to build full organizational profiles with leadership details.\n\n**Input:** Array of LinkedIn company URLs (e.g., 10-20 companies)\n\n**Output:** Complete org chart for EACH company including:\n- Company details (name, industry, size, website)\n- Employee count\n- Full employee roster\n- Leadership profiles with bios\n\n**Scalability:** Processes up to 20 companies in batches of 5, extracting 10+ employee profiles per company\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Get API key from https://linkfinderai.com\n2. Replace YOUR_API_KEY_HERE in all LinkFinder AI nodes (5 total)\n3. Edit input data with your company URLs\n4. Test the workflow\n\n**Services used:**\n- linkedin_company_to_linkedin_info\n- linkedin_company_to_employees\n- linkedin_profile_to_linkedin_info\n\n**Perfect for:**\n- Sales teams building account maps\n- Recruiters mapping organizations\n- Competitive intelligence\n- Market research on multiple companies",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
